# ANCHORED to the repository root, and it must stay that way.
#
# Written bare as `data/`, this pattern matched a directory named `data` at
# ANY depth. It was meant for the sync layer's export dump at the root, but
# it also silently swallowed src/features/seating/data/ — the generated
# seating dataset the application imports. `git add -A` skipped it without a
# word, the commit looked complete, and a clean clone failed to build with
# "Failed to resolve import @/features/seating/data/seatingSource".
/data/
scripts/sync/logs/
scratch/

# Built guest guides — regenerate with `npm run pdf:guides`
dist/guides/

# Licensed audio. The recording is under copyright and is NOT committed —
# it is supplied at deploy time. See public/audio/README.md.
public/audio/*
!public/audio/README.md

# Vercel CLI scratch output — never committed.
.vercel/
